# Drop original mission photos here before upload.
# Name files exactly by `image_slug` from missions-mongolia-sights.json
# Examples: gandan.jpg, lake-khuvsgul.png, khongoryn-els.jpeg
#
# Then run from apps/nomad-go-v2:
#   npm install          # ensures sharp is available
#   node scripts/compress-upload-mission-images.mjs --compress-only
#   node scripts/compress-upload-mission-images.mjs
#
# Compressed output: supabase/seeds/mission-images/compressed/
# Target size: ~200-300KB JPEG, max 1600px edge (matches app upload standards)
